## Assets not pushed yet (git size)

To keep the repo lightweight during pre-festival development:

- **Sprite packs** under `Assets/_Project/Art/Sprites/Pixel Art Heroes/` are **kept local and NOT committed for now** (open-license pixel sheets used by the lite-harness `UnitView`). Temporary (`пока не пушим`) — added later (likely via Git LFS or a curated subset) once the visual set for the 7 relics is finalized.
- **Dev screenshots** (e.g. `Assets/Screenshots/`, MCP harness captures) are throwaway — **delete them, never commit**.

When staging, **stage code/data/config explicitly — never `git add .` blindly** (it would sweep in the sprite packs).

